    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>MapRecord</code></a> instance backed by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> holding field/value pairs.\n<br/>\nYou may want to use the builders available via <a href=\"StreamRecords.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>StreamRecords</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个由给定 Map 支持的<a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream 中的接口\"><code>MapRecord</code></a>实例，该 Map 存储字段/值对。\n<br/>\n您可能希望使用通过<a href=\"StreamRecords.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream 中的类\"><code>StreamRecords</code></a>提供的构建器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ObjectRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>ObjectRecord</code></a> instance backed by the given value. The value may be a simple type,\nlike <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> or a complex one. <br/>\nYou may want to use the builders available via <a href=\"StreamRecords.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>StreamRecords</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的由给定值支持的<a href=\"ObjectRecord.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream 中的接口\"><code>ObjectRecord</code></a>实例。该值可以是简单类型（例如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>String</code></a>），也可以是复杂类型。<br/>\n您可能希望使用通过<a href=\"StreamRecords.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream 中的类\"><code>StreamRecords</code></a>提供的构建器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A single entry in the stream consisting of the <a href=\"RecordId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>entry-id</code></a> and the actual entry-value (typically a\ncollection of <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>field/value pairs</code></a>).",
      "translation": "流中的单个条目，由 `<a href=\"RecordId.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>entry-id</code></a>` 和实际的条目值（通常是一组 <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>字段/值对</code></a>）组成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>MapRecord</code></a> instance backed by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> holding field/value pairs.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"MapRecord.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream 中的接口\"><code>MapRecord</code></a>实例，该实例由给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Map</code></a>支持，该 Map 持有字段/值对。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ObjectRecord.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>ObjectRecord</code></a> instance backed by the given value.",
      "translation": "根据给定的值创建一个新的由该值支持的<a href=\"ObjectRecord.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream 中的接口\"><code>ObjectRecord</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-V\"><code>V</code> - the type backing the <a href=\"Record.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.stream\"><code>Record</code></a>.</span>",
